======================================================================
Part 3: verdict
======================================================================
See per-(d,m) rows above. J_identically_0=True means the linear
vanishing conditions alone rule out any Keller pair (J=1) in this
bridge topology. J_identically_0=False is INCONCLUSIVE: the exact
order and deg[phi_0:psi_0]=m still have to be imposed.
